Additional Notice
-----------------

This project packages and extends the original Batrium WatchMon UDP Listener:

https://github.com/Batrium/WatchMonUdpListener

The original Batrium WatchMon UDP Listener is listed as MIT licensed in its
package metadata. Any original Batrium files, source code, protocol handlers,
payload parsers, documentation or other upstream materials remain subject to
their original copyright and license terms.

Additional Home Assistant app/add-on packaging, persistent configuration
handling, host-network deployment support and Ingress web UI are provided by
Dwayne Godden.
